sequenceDiagram
    title Leave request
    autonumber
    actor E as Employee
    participant P as HR portal
    participant M as Manager
    participant DB as HR database

    E->>+P: Submit a leave request
    P->>DB: Check the remaining days
    DB-->>P: 12 days left
    P->>+M: Ask for approval
    Note right of M: Checks the team calendar
    alt enough people in the team
        M-->>P: Approve
        P->>DB: Record the leave
    else too many people away
        M--xP: Reject, with a reason
    end
    deactivate M
    loop every Monday until answered
        P->>P: Send a reminder
    end
    P-->>-E: Decision by e-mail
    Note over E,P: The employee can cancel until the day before
